        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park, Caldera de Taburiente National Park, Sálvora, Galicia, La Palma, Canary Islands, Spain, Santa Uxía de Ribeira\n- Topics: National parks, municipalities\n\nFacts:\n- The Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park is the only national park in the autonomous community of Galicia, Spain.\n- Caldera de Taburiente National Park is a large geological feature on the island of La Palma in the Canary Islands, Spain.\n- Sálvora belongs to the municipality of Santa Uxía de Ribeira.\n- Sálvora is part of the Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park.",
